---
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<section class="pt-14 pb-16 sm:pt-16 sm:pb-20 lg:pt-24 lg:pb-24 border-b border-monolith-line dark:border-monolith-darkLine">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 max-w-6xl">
    <p class="eyebrow">{site.role}</p>
    <h1 class="text-[2.5rem] sm:text-6xl font-medium [text-wrap:balance] leading-[1.06] tracking-tightest">
      I deliver enterprise systems across APAC,<br class="hidden xl:block" /> <span class="italic font-normal font-serif">and build and run software of my own.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="text-base sm:text-lg muted leading-relaxed max-w-2xl pt-2">I manage business platforms across Asia-Pacific markets, from e-commerce and CMS to CRM and service desk, together with the vendor teams that build and support them. I've also been building software of my own for years, starting with Windows tools that have since been downloaded hundreds of thousands of times, and now web apps and browser extensions.</p>
  </div>
</section>
